OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloud and rain clears the south
OL,6,Fthrough the morning, with some sunny
OL,7,Fspells developing later. Chillier, but
OL,8,Fbrighter further North, with a few
OL,9,Fscattered showers along North Sea
OL,10,Fcoasts, turning wintery in the far
OL,11,Fnorth. A chillier day for most.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FLargely dry, though some
OL,14,Fshowers in the far north. Clear skies
OL,15,Fallow for widespread frost
OL,16,Fdevelopment. With light winds, fog
OL,17,Fpatches develop across central and
OL,18,Fsouthern England and Northern Ireland.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
