OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FA crisp start to the
OL,6,Fweekend, with long sunny spells
OL,7,Fthrough the day. Skies turn cloudier
OL,8,Fin the southwest with rain later and
OL,9,Fstrong winds developing towards the
OL,10,Fcoast overnight.
